            <ArticleTitle>Assessment of the patient with acute abdominal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>67-75</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Abdominal pain has many causes, from simple to complex presentations. Patients with abdominal pain may have a number of physiological and psychological needs. Nurses have a key role to play in patient assessment, history taking and management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
